source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An escaped ampersand keeps the reference itself in the href, where the reader shows `&#124;` as text; jiro writes a target that holds a reference back the same way.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x/a&#38;#124;b]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x/a&#38;#124;b" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x/a&amp;#124;b)
-- warnings.json --
[]
